{"id":"c3afc4c71ad0b7f9","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-overspill.md","title":"Overspill Principle","display":"df-overspill — Overspill Principle","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-overspill","aliases":["92-df-overspill"],"display":"df-overspill — Overspill Principle","depends_on":["[[92-df-nonstandard-model]]","[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-numeral]]","[[92-df-interpretation]]","[[92-df-free-variable-function]]","[[92-df-assignment]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-overspill"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-overspill</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-overspill — Overspill Principle"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"47757ea7c4cfcbd4\" href=\"?note=47757ea7c4cfcbd4\" title=\"92-df-nonstandard-model\">92-df-nonstandard-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2b7f27c890af1dc3\" href=\"?note=2b7f27c890af1dc3\" title=\"92-df-interpretation\">92-df-interpretation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fdcbc43c728f79fc\" href=\"?note=fdcbc43c728f79fc\" title=\"92-df-assignment\">92-df-assignment</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M=(M,I)\">\\(\\mathfrak M=(M,I)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NonStd}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{NonStd}_G\\)</span> (arithmetic structure and nonstandard-model predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"47757ea7c4cfcbd4\" href=\"?note=47757ea7c4cfcbd4\" title=\"92-df-nonstandard-model\">92-df-nonstandard-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\">\\(v_0\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\)</span> (formula and distinguished variable)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G\\)</span> (free-variable function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n^{\\mathfrak M}\">\\(\\bar n^{\\mathfrak M}\\)</span> (interpretation of the numeral for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_G\">\\(\\models_G\\)</span> (satisfaction relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"2b7f27c890af1dc3\" href=\"?note=2b7f27c890af1dc3\" title=\"92-df-interpretation\">92-df-interpretation</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\beta_a)_{a\\in M}\">\\((\\beta_a)_{a\\in M}\\)</span> (assignments into <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> satisfying <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta_a(v_0)=a\">\\(\\beta_a(v_0)=a\\)</span>, as supplied by <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"fdcbc43c728f79fc\" href=\"?note=fdcbc43c728f79fc\" title=\"92-df-assignment\">92-df-assignment</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Std}^{\\mathfrak M},\\mathrm{Overspill}\">\\(\\mathrm{Std}^{\\mathfrak M},\\mathrm{Overspill}\\)</span> (definition targets for the standard cut and overspill condition)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}overspill} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Std}^{\\mathfrak M}\\coloneqq\\{\\bar n^{\\mathfrak M}\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Overspill}(\\mathfrak M,\\varphi)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{NonStd}_G(\\mathfrak M)\\land\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\\land\n\\Bigl[\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\mathfrak M,\\beta_{\\bar n^{\\mathfrak M}}\\models_G\\varphi)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists a\\in M\\setminus\\mathrm{Std}^{\\mathfrak M}\\;(\\mathfrak M,\\beta_a\\models_G\\varphi)\n\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}overspill} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Std}^{\\mathfrak M}\\coloneqq\\{\\bar n^{\\mathfrak M}\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Overspill}(\\mathfrak M,\\varphi)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{NonStd}_G(\\mathfrak M)\\land\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\\land\n\\Bigl[\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\mathfrak M,\\beta_{\\bar n^{\\mathfrak M}}\\models_G\\varphi)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists a\\in M\\setminus\\mathrm{Std}^{\\mathfrak M}\\;(\\mathfrak M,\\beta_a\\models_G\\varphi)\n\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>溢出原理：标准真理溢出到非标准</li>\n<li>若一个只含自由变量<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\">\\(v_0\\)</span>的内部公式对所有标准numeral的解释成立</li>\n<li>则存在非标准<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>使公式成立</li>\n<li>赋值<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta_a\">\\(\\beta_a\\)</span>使“把模型元素<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span>代入公式”成为正式满足关系，而不是把语法公式写成可直接应用于域元素的函数</li>\n<li>用于分析非标准元素</li>\n<li>溢出是模型论技术</li>\n<li>用于证明PA的性质</li>\n<li>非标准模型的特征</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-nonstandard-model","status":"resolved","id":"47757ea7c4cfcbd4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-nonstandard-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"b78092e29a02d697","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"2b7f27c890af1dc3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-interpretation]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-free-variable-function","status":"resolved","id":"b9e3d57e94ce36b7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-free-variable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"fdcbc43c728f79fc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-nonstandard-model","status":"resolved","id":"47757ea7c4cfcbd4","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak M=(M,I)$ and $\\mathrm{NonStd}_G$ (arithmetic structure and nonstandard-model predicate, see [[92-df-nonstandard-model]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-free-variable-function","status":"resolved","id":"b9e3d57e94ce36b7","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypot